92	Assess selected fields (blank means all), using scope and evidence as context. Missing selected fields, contradictory instructions,
93	ambiguous evidence or insufficient confidence require review, not guesses. Keep mixed-topic items intact whenever any part is relevant.
94	Positive, negative, conflicting and minority evidence are all relevant; do not discard praise or disagreement merely for its stance.
95	Give a nonblank reason of at most 2000 characters and confidence 0..1. Quotes must be nonempty exact verbatim substrings
